# Prefer existing libraries

Before writing a utility, component, or concurrency helper, search npm and check
`package.json` for a maintained package. Write custom code only when no package
fits.

- Check https://www.npmjs.com for a maintained package that solves the problem
- For UI patterns, check https://mantine.dev and add the matching `@mantine/*`
  package (for example `@mantine/lightbox` instead of a `Modal` plus an `Image`)

Example: use `p-queue` for concurrency instead of a hand-written limiter.
